  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release v1.1.0.\n      - Introduced state-based (TState) overloads for all execution paths to enable zero-allocation retries.\n      - Optimized fast-path latency (down to ~1.0 us for sync calls).\n      - Achieved true Zero Allocation (0 B) in both sync and async fast-path scenarios.\n      - Enhanced README with performance benchmarks and advanced usage examples.\n      - Maintained full thread-safety and minimalist API surface.",
